   "text": "routed experts 256×64 **927.71B** (97.4%) · attention ×66 **8.58B** (0.9%) · shared experts ×2 + router ×64 **7.35B** (0.8%) · dense FFN ×2 **906.0M** (<0.1%) · embed **1.24B** (0.1%) · lm head **1.24B** (0.1%) · MTP ×8 **5.26B** (0.6%) · vision encoder **83.7M** (<0.1%) · audio encoder **7.9M** (<0.1%) · norms + MLP short-convs **2.4M** (<0.1%)"
  },
