  {
   "id": "cap-bcl",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1450,
   "width": 2600,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "routed experts 256×64 **21.74B** (54.6%) · attention ×66 **8.58B** (21.6%) · shared experts ×2 + router ×64 **7.35B** (18.5%) · dense FFN ×2 **906.0M** (2.3%) · lm head **1.24B** (3.1%) · embed **0** (row lookup) · MTP ×8 **0** (only when drafting) · vision encoder **0** (runs per image) · audio encoder **0** (runs per audio frame) · norms + MLP short-convs **2.4M** (<0.1%)"
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1300,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "# Inkling — model  \nRead top → bottom. **Grey bars = tensors**, length ∝ channels per token (0.08 px/channel). **Boxes = operations**, all one size; where parameters and compute live is the pair of bars above. T = sequence length, P = 40×40 image patches, F = 50 ms audio frames. *Layer* tab = one decoder layer in detail."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 450,
   "y": -1300,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "Every layer = **GQA attention with no RoPE**: position comes from a learned, input-dependent relative bias over the last 512 (sliding) or 1024 (global) distances, plus depthwise causal short-convs (kernel 4) on k, v and both sub-block outputs.    \nRow colours — **amber**: sliding 512 + dense SwiGLU FFN (L0–1) · **grey**: sliding 512, 16 KV heads + MoE · **cyan**: global, 8 KV heads + MoE (every 6th layer). MoE = 6 of 256 routed experts + 2 shared, one sigmoid router scores all 258."
  },
  {
   "id": "raw1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -980,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**raw text**  \"Describe this…\"",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "tok2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -884,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**tokenizer** (tiktoken, vocab 201,024)",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
