  },
  {
   "id": "note-pattern",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -760,
   "y": 165,
   "width": 600,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "**Layer pattern** — 55 sliding + 11 global layers ([sliding ×5, global] ×11).  \nSliding: 64 query / 16 KV heads, causal window 512, relative bias over all 512 distances. Global: 64 query / 8 KV heads over the whole context; relative bias only for the last 1024 tokens, beyond that no position signal at all, and past position 128,000 queries are scaled by 1 + 0.1·ln(pos / 128,000)."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-kv",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -760,
   "y": 465,
   "width": 600,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "**KV cache per token per layer**: sliding K+V = 2×16×128 = 4096 values but only the last 512 tokens; global 2×8×128 = 2048 values for every token — so at long context the 11 global layers hold nearly all of it. Each layer also keeps 3 past steps for each of its 4 short-convs."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-layer",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -760,
   "y": 675,
   "width": 600,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "**One MoE layer** ≈ attention 132.2M (sliding) / 119.6M (global) + router 1.6M + 2 shared experts 113.2M + 256 routed experts × 56.6M, of which 6 run per token. Expert SwiGLU width 3072; dense layers L0–1 use one SwiGLU 24576 (453.0M)."
  },
  {
   "id": "ho39",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -96,
   "y": 1063,
   "width": 492,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl40",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -556,
   "y": 1051,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`h [T, 6144]  after L65`"
  },
  {
   "id": "fn41",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1112,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**final RMSNorm** (llm.norm)",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
