   "x": 1550,
   "y": 1530,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 72,
   "text": "**1 decoder block** — attention as listed →  \n+ **dense** SwiGLU 24576 (no MoE)  \n582.0M · avg per layer",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
