   "text": "`draft token t+k+1`"
  },
  {
   "id": "mver64",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1550,
   "y": 1803,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 72,
   "text": "**verify**: main model checks the  \ndrafts in its next forward",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-mrows",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2750,
   "y": 1013,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 40,
   "text": "**8 MTP layers**, each feeds the next:"
  },
  {
   "id": "M0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2750,
   "y": 1063,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "**MTP0** · sliding 512 → t+2",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "M1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2750,
   "y": 1103,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "**MTP1** · global → t+3",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "M2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2750,
   "y": 1143,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "**MTP2** · sliding 512 → t+4",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "M3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2750,
   "y": 1183,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "**MTP3** · global → t+5",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "M4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2750,
   "y": 1223,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "**MTP4** · sliding 512 → t+6",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "M5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2750,
   "y": 1263,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "**MTP5** · sliding 512 → t+7",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "M6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2750,
   "y": 1303,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "**MTP6** · sliding 512 → t+8",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "M7",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2750,
   "y": 1343,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "**MTP7** · sliding 512 → t+9",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-mtp",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2750,
   "y": 1403,
   "width": 640,
   "height": 230,
   "text": "MTP = multi-token prediction (8 layers, 5.26B stored). Layer k mixes the hidden state of layer k−1 (the main model's for k = 0) with the embedding of the next known token and predicts one token further, so the chain can draft several tokens per step for speculative decoding. transformers skips model.mtp.* on load; this wiring is read from its tensor names and config.json's mtp_config (chain_hidden_post_norm = false)."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-src",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": 1906,
   "width": 1300,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "**Sources.** config.json + safetensors headers of thinkingmachines/Inkling (1552 tensors, BF16 + F32 router biases; experts stored as stacked [256, …] tensors). All tensors sum to **952.38B** (the README says 975B total, 41B active). Dataflow from transformers modeling_inkling.py. Context 1,048,576 tokens (model_max_length); no rotary embedding anywhere."
  }
